The webtiles socket becomes a JS message queue (wasm/bridge.h): output
is handed to the host, control messages are popped from it, and the input
waits suspend instead of select()ing. Adds the host-requested `checkpoint`
save and the `ending` message, and skips the spectator map dump before the
first view is drawn.

Modified for the WebAssembly build of the webtiles binary (engine/README.md).
GPLv2+, as the file it patches.

